ero_title:"Claude Cheat",home_hero_subtitle:"Discover, rank, and install from the public Claude Code skill ecosystem!",home_intro:"We crawl, score, and rank every public .claude/skills, .claude/commands, .claude/agents and .claude/hooks across 40+ GitHub repos! Browse the leaderboard, catch what's trending, learn what makes a great skill, and assemble your own install set in one go!",home_start_label:"Get started",home_card_leaderboard_title:"Leaderboard",home_card_leaderboard_desc:"All 695 collected skills ranked by composite score (popularity, freshness, quality, curation)! Filter by class or category, search by name, find the right one fast.",home_card_trending_title:"Trending",home_card_trending_desc:"See what's rising in the hottest repos and newest entries! Keyword lift surfaces exactly what's surging compared to the baseline. Catch the wave!",home_card_guide_title:"Guide",home_card_guide_desc:"How to write a great Claude skill? Patterns distilled from 537 top-rated skills, backed by raw stats and clickable example skills you can study right now!",home_card_cart_title:"Cart",home_card_cart_desc:"Star the skills you love across the leaderboard and trending pages! The cart hands you a one-liner install script: one git clone per source repo, ready to run.",footer_text:"Claude Cheat \xb7 built on the skill-collector pipeline. Composite = 0.45\xb7popularity + 0.15\xb7freshness + 0.10\xb7maintained + 0.20\xb7quality + 0.10\xb7curated",lb_hero_subtitle:"Every Claude skill, ranked & ready to install!",lb_meta:"{n} of {total} skills shown \xb7 dataset generated {time}",lb_loading:"Loading dataset…",lb_load_failed:"Failed to load dataset",lb_load_failed_hint:"Run skill-collector update, then npm run build.",filter_search_placeholder:"Search name, description, or repo…",filter_all_categories:"All categories",filter_all_classes:"All classes",filter_curated:"Curated",filter_skills_only:"Skills only",filter_clear_all:"Clear all",th_composite:"Composite",th_pop:"Pop",th_fres